    <guid isPermaLink="false">69ba59c27db61f79fc586614</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 19 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong><span>南哥</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/6407e9b2000000000800ffde?app_platform=ios&amp;app_version=7.77&amp;share_from_user_hidden=true&amp;type=normal&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5657c50a44760829ace1d413&amp;apptime=1678865397" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/6407e9b2000000000800ffde?app_platform=ios&amp;app_version=7.77&amp;share_from_user_hidden=true&amp;type=normal&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5657c50a44760829ace1d413&amp;apptime=1678865397"><span>xiaonaneo</span></a><span> &amp; </span><a href="https://okjk.co/U9yoWn" data-url="https://okjk.co/U9yoWn"><span>心理咨询师王总总</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>打羽毛球是为了快乐，不是为了成为球场老登，也不是为了去打奥运会。但是不知不觉，就把“优绩主义”、“好学生思维”带来的紧张感，也放在了球场里。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但当我学会示弱、庆祝自己的失误，才理解放松的强大力量。勤奋和松弛，真的不是反义词。他们可以共存。你只是为了“玩”儿。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>如果你想找魏教练！给我留言吧~</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>听友群&amp;咨询：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>sweetdreamer2022</span></p>]]></description>
